<p>Renders a <code>&lt;th&gt;</code>. <code>scope</code> defaults to
  <code>"col"</code>. Use <code>scope="row"</code> for row headers.
  Add <code>classes: "table-col-numeric"</code> to right-align
  numeric columns. See the
  <a href="/components/table/">Table demo</a> for the composed
  example.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;Table label="Users"&gt;
  &lt;TableHead&gt;
    &lt;TableRow&gt;
      &lt;TableTH&gt;Name&lt;/TableTH&gt;
      &lt;TableTH&gt;Email&lt;/TableTH&gt;
    &lt;/TableRow&gt;
  &lt;/TableHead&gt;
  &lt;TableBody&gt;
    &lt;TableRow&gt;
      &lt;TableTD&gt;Alice&lt;/TableTD&gt;
      &lt;TableTD&gt;alice@example.com&lt;/TableTD&gt;
    &lt;/TableRow&gt;
  &lt;/TableBody&gt;
&lt;/Table&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
